WEBVTT

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:29.850
Well, take care of yourself, Yagami.

00:01:30.170 --> 00:01:30.710
Huh?

00:01:32.540 --> 00:01:33.320
Mr. Godai!?

00:01:36.010 --> 00:01:38.090
Eeek! A burglar!

00:01:38.680 --> 00:01:39.640
I-I'm not...!

00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:45.900
Eeek! A peeping tom!
It's a peeping tom!

00:01:46.150 --> 00:01:47.200
I am not!

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:51.750
G-Godai!

00:01:56.760 --> 00:01:57.540
I'm home...

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:00.090
H-Has something happened?

00:02:01.030 --> 00:02:05.590
A lot of things have...
but I'm home, at last.

00:02:07.130 --> 00:02:08.800
Oh... Where are your shoes?

00:02:13.970 --> 00:02:16.810
Mr. Godai was in such a hurry.

00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:22.970
We'll meet again,
won't we, Mr. Godai?

00:02:43.110 --> 00:02:44.030
Good-bye!

00:02:44.110 --> 00:02:44.900
Good-bye...

00:02:45.210 --> 00:02:49.300
Uh-oh... Ma, my lunch money!
My lunch money!

00:02:50.370 --> 00:02:54.130
Dumb kid! You should have
told me yesterday.

00:02:54.250 --> 00:02:55.530
I know! I know!

00:02:58.090 --> 00:02:59.440
Watch out for cars.

00:02:59.530 --> 00:03:00.280
I will!

00:03:03.300 --> 00:03:04.280
Good morning!

00:03:05.800 --> 00:03:07.410
Oh, good morning.

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:09.060
Beautiful day, isn't it?

00:03:09.130 --> 00:03:09.860
Yes.

00:03:11.770 --> 00:03:13.620
It'll probably be another hot day.

00:03:14.130 --> 00:03:15.560
Well, I'd better be going.

00:03:16.340 --> 00:03:17.220
Good-bye...

00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:24.340
Something must have happened
at the Yagamis' home.

00:03:25.750 --> 00:03:29.500
What...?! You let him escape
through the window?

00:03:29.710 --> 00:03:34.180
What could I do? I hadn't told
my folks about my tutor.

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:37.500
Too bad...
You finally got him alone.

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:42.090
What would you have done
if your folks hadn't come home?

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:42.750
Huh?

00:03:43.190 --> 00:03:45.530
Come on, Etsuko...
What are you thinking?

00:03:45.590 --> 00:03:48.960
Tell me... What is it? What is it?
What are you talking about?

00:03:49.030 --> 00:03:51.000
You really don't get it?

00:03:51.130 --> 00:03:52.150
Well...

00:03:52.310 --> 00:03:54.630
So, what are you going to do now?

00:03:54.780 --> 00:03:57.800
Mr. Godai's not going to tutor you
anymore, is he?

00:04:01.280 --> 00:04:03.120
That's the thing...

00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:37.350
If I give him back his sneakers,
it'll be the end.

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:40.000
I don't think
I'll return them today.

00:04:40.430 --> 00:04:42.550
Little missy...?

00:04:42.730 --> 00:04:43.200
Huh?

00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:48.950
Bamboo waving to and fro,
Urashima, saving...

00:04:50.040 --> 00:04:51.580
Hello!

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:53.160
Mr. Yotsuya!

00:04:53.630 --> 00:04:57.250
Oh, you remember me?
I'm flattered.

00:04:57.330 --> 00:05:00.600
You make me very, very happy.

00:05:00.870 --> 00:05:02.240
Is that for young Godai?

00:05:02.310 --> 00:05:02.740
Huh?

00:05:03.850 --> 00:05:06.630
Oh, uh...no, it's nothing.

00:05:08.920 --> 00:05:13.850
You look so very anxious.
If you have some problem...

00:05:14.360 --> 00:05:16.290
won't you give me
your phone number?

00:05:16.360 --> 00:05:18.120
No, I don't think so.
Good-bye.

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:38.200
Huh?

00:05:40.640 --> 00:05:42.810
Would you throw away this old pair?

00:05:43.560 --> 00:05:44.610
Please come again.

00:05:45.880 --> 00:05:47.270
Manager...

00:05:49.360 --> 00:05:51.140
Is that what happened?

00:05:51.320 --> 00:05:52.080
Yes...

00:05:52.520 --> 00:05:53.950
What a problem.

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:57.250
Yes. She's really a nice girl...

00:05:58.000 --> 00:05:59.320
I guess so.

00:05:59.970 --> 00:06:04.370
Girls, at that age, can be frighteningly
single-minded.

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:09.910
You were once like that?

00:06:10.350 --> 00:06:10.930
Huh?

00:06:11.850 --> 00:06:15.980
That's right. I was just like
all the other girls.

00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:18.240
I can't believe it.

00:06:18.620 --> 00:06:22.130
That's why I can understand
how she feels.

00:06:22.750 --> 00:06:26.990
But, thankfully, I won't need to have
anything to do with her, anymore.

00:06:27.620 --> 00:06:28.850
I guess so.

00:06:33.970 --> 00:06:36.690
You're late, aren't you?

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:40.170
What are you doing here?

00:06:40.310 --> 00:06:42.430
I have been waiting for you.

00:06:43.370 --> 00:06:46.810
A most beautiful maiden
came a-calling.

00:06:47.290 --> 00:06:50.870
She bade me give this
parcel to you.

00:06:55.560 --> 00:06:56.420
It was Yagami!

00:06:56.500 --> 00:06:57.010
Oh, my...

00:06:57.750 --> 00:06:59.750
Wasn't there any message?

00:07:04.540 --> 00:07:07.890
Just, "I'm sorry to have troubled you."

00:07:08.040 --> 00:07:09.660
Was that all?

00:07:09.870 --> 00:07:10.430
Yes.

00:07:12.480 --> 00:07:14.190
She gave up so easily.

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:15.300
Yes...

00:07:16.070 --> 00:07:17.620
Is that something to eat?

00:07:17.720 --> 00:07:19.370
You can eat it, if you like... Here.

00:07:40.060 --> 00:07:43.080
Your pace is up, tonight...
Has something happened?

00:07:43.700 --> 00:07:44.630
No. Nothing at all.

00:07:44.770 --> 00:07:48.910
Something good probably happened
between you and the manager, right?

00:07:48.980 --> 00:07:49.670
No.

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:54.180
You've been pretty popular, recently...
like among high school girls.

00:07:54.380 --> 00:07:56.620
That's no measure of my popularity.

00:07:56.990 --> 00:08:00.220
Anyway, I have nothing to do
with her, anymore.

00:08:00.380 --> 00:08:03.070
What...?! What a waste!

00:08:11.100 --> 00:08:13.250
They're really having a good
time, tonight.

00:08:32.730 --> 00:08:35.910
Nothing happened For the next
2-3 days, but...

00:08:39.700 --> 00:08:41.360
Excuse me!

00:08:49.980 --> 00:08:52.160
What are you doing here,
Miss Yagami?

00:08:52.480 --> 00:08:54.370
Today is the day for my tutoring.

00:08:55.250 --> 00:08:58.210
Tutoring?! But, the last time...

00:08:58.270 --> 00:08:58.920
Hi!

00:08:59.410 --> 00:09:00.630
Welcome.

00:09:08.360 --> 00:09:10.590
Good evening, Teacher.

00:09:11.100 --> 00:09:12.750
-Yotsuya...!
-Teacher...?

00:09:13.200 --> 00:09:15.460
Mr. Yotsuya, you look wonderful!

00:09:21.110 --> 00:09:22.760
Miss Yagami, may I see you
for a minute?

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:23.900
Come, quickly!

00:09:23.980 --> 00:09:26.260
-What is it?
-Don't worry; just come.

00:09:26.350 --> 00:09:27.210
Here. This way.

00:09:34.820 --> 00:09:35.790
What's this all about?

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:37.610
Shh... Not so loud.

00:09:37.910 --> 00:09:41.530
Miss Yagami, do you realize
what sort of man Mr. Yotsuya is?

00:09:41.690 --> 00:09:43.080
What sort of man is he?

00:09:44.390 --> 00:09:48.150
I really don't want to say this
about one of my tenants...

00:09:48.620 --> 00:09:49.590
but, he's no good.

00:09:49.660 --> 00:09:51.220
He's dangerous!

00:09:51.500 --> 00:09:54.090
He's like someone who sprays
toxic gas around town.

00:09:54.610 --> 00:09:56.620
Job unclear... Age unknown...

00:09:56.840 --> 00:09:58.760
An eccentric, a weirdo, a parasite!

00:09:58.840 --> 00:10:00.920
Is that so?!

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:04.800
That's terrible! Why, that scared
the daylights out of me!

00:10:04.870 --> 00:10:06.340
Were you stunned too, Rika?

00:10:09.910 --> 00:10:12.350
Come in. The room's a bit dirty...

00:10:12.860 --> 00:10:13.870
Thank you!

00:10:15.150 --> 00:10:19.380
Wow! Your room's beautiful
Mr. Yotsuya!

00:10:21.730 --> 00:10:23.270
Should we leave them alone?

00:10:23.500 --> 00:10:26.360
No way...
She's my former student.

00:10:26.660 --> 00:10:29.690
I can't leave her in the hands
of that viper.

00:10:30.240 --> 00:10:33.290
I can't allow scandalous behavior
in this building.

00:10:34.110 --> 00:10:35.470
We have no choice...

00:10:52.200 --> 00:10:54.460
What shall we play?

00:10:54.730 --> 00:10:58.620
Well... Whatever you like.

00:11:02.340 --> 00:11:06.740
Whatever I like...? Well...

00:11:06.800 --> 00:11:08.790
Cards...or Othello...

00:11:09.820 --> 00:11:14.170
I've got it! There's nothing like
taking a peek.

00:11:14.910 --> 00:11:16.500
Can you see anything?

00:11:16.820 --> 00:11:18.210
Just a wall.

00:11:20.280 --> 00:11:22.300
Uh...Miss Yagami...

00:11:22.860 --> 00:11:23.500
Yes?

00:11:25.150 --> 00:11:26.750
May I hold your hand?

00:11:27.790 --> 00:11:28.990
Oh, the closet...

00:11:29.420 --> 00:11:30.400
It's just your imagination.

00:11:31.030 --> 00:11:32.870
Please don't hold my hand.

00:11:33.030 --> 00:11:34.870
Then, how about a knuckle?

00:11:35.900 --> 00:11:38.070
Do you suppose he's just
baiting us?

00:11:38.670 --> 00:11:40.730
Mr. Yotsuya, shall I make you
some coffee?

00:11:41.270 --> 00:11:43.790
Oh, well, the coffee cups are...

00:11:44.850 --> 00:11:46.300
Miss Yagami!

00:11:49.460 --> 00:11:51.480
Yotsuya! What are you...?

00:12:26.650 --> 00:12:27.630
Oh...?

00:12:27.730 --> 00:12:30.990
So you're going to study
in Mr. Godai's room, from now on?

00:12:31.130 --> 00:12:33.150
Yes. That's right.

00:12:34.930 --> 00:12:36.370
That's great, Yagami!

00:12:36.500 --> 00:12:38.360
It's nice that you'll be back
together again.

00:12:38.610 --> 00:12:41.840
I guess.
Although we won't be alone...

00:12:41.900 --> 00:12:46.240
But, for now, I'm happy that we'll be
in the same room together.

00:12:46.610 --> 00:12:49.130
My, my... Isn't that lovely?

00:12:49.980 --> 00:12:52.470
I'll bet the widow didn't look happy.

00:12:55.050 --> 00:12:57.910
Well, it's just too bad!
She was peeping, after all.

00:12:59.020 --> 00:13:00.010
Peeping...?

00:13:00.520 --> 00:13:02.150
Let me play too!

00:13:02.600 --> 00:13:03.990
What did she mean, peeping?

00:13:04.360 --> 00:13:08.220
Huh? Peeping?
Who peeped at what?

00:13:08.290 --> 00:13:10.630
Why don't you just keep
your nose in that book?!

00:13:12.840 --> 00:13:13.390
There!

00:13:16.640 --> 00:13:17.180
Here it comes!

00:13:31.150 --> 00:13:33.090
No! Soichiro!

00:13:35.230 --> 00:13:38.450
If you eat things on the ground,
you'll get a tummy ache.

00:13:41.560 --> 00:13:42.540
Good evening!

00:13:42.740 --> 00:13:44.400
Oh, Miss Yagami...

00:13:44.600 --> 00:13:45.950
Out for a walk?

00:13:46.370 --> 00:13:47.230
Yes.

00:13:48.610 --> 00:13:50.000
No! Soichiro!

00:13:50.240 --> 00:13:52.520
Is Mr. Godai at home?

00:13:52.750 --> 00:13:54.030
Why, yes.

00:13:55.270 --> 00:13:56.900
I'm so happy.

00:13:57.220 --> 00:14:01.480
To be honest, I was a little nervous
about being alone with Mr. Yotsuya.

00:14:02.020 --> 00:14:04.380
I caused you concern, too.

00:14:04.680 --> 00:14:10.310
But, with Mr. Godai nearby,
I can study without worrying.

00:14:10.690 --> 00:14:14.310
Is that so...?
Good luck with your studies.

00:14:14.520 --> 00:14:17.760
Thank you. I'll do my best...
in my studies, too.

00:14:18.370 --> 00:14:19.630
Well, good-bye.

00:14:22.700 --> 00:14:23.420
Too...?

00:14:43.690 --> 00:14:46.130
Hey, come on... Have a drink.

00:14:50.770 --> 00:14:54.100
Come on, come on... Study hard.

00:14:55.640 --> 00:14:57.000
Study hard...

00:14:58.150 --> 00:15:00.740
What are you doing?
They're studying!

00:15:01.040 --> 00:15:03.640
What's wrong?
We're cheering them on.

00:15:04.020 --> 00:15:07.810
It's the first time we've seen
Yotsuya at work.

00:15:08.120 --> 00:15:11.200
But, Miss Yagami is studying.

00:15:11.590 --> 00:15:12.520
I'm fine.

00:15:13.130 --> 00:15:16.390
It doesn't bother me
so don't worry.

00:15:18.420 --> 00:15:20.150
It bothers me!

00:15:20.600 --> 00:15:24.590
But, Young Godai,
I get peeping toms in my room,

00:15:24.660 --> 00:15:27.360
so we can't concentrate
on our work.

00:15:28.140 --> 00:15:29.650
And therefore...

00:15:29.740 --> 00:15:32.820
we'll continue to study in this room,
as we decided the other day.

00:15:32.900 --> 00:15:34.000
That's wonderful!

00:15:34.980 --> 00:15:36.500
I didn't decide on it!

00:15:37.040 --> 00:15:39.480
Then, shall we study in my room?

00:15:39.540 --> 00:15:41.700
No peeking, now.

00:15:43.050 --> 00:15:45.450
Okay, let's get back
to our studies.

00:15:45.520 --> 00:15:46.220
All right!

00:16:00.030 --> 00:16:01.090
Manager!

00:16:03.640 --> 00:16:06.400
I'm sorry for all the
trouble because of Yagami.

00:16:06.480 --> 00:16:08.740
Oh, it's fine with me.

00:16:09.620 --> 00:16:11.900
But, at this rate, you...

00:16:12.150 --> 00:16:13.030
Yeah...

00:16:14.540 --> 00:16:18.060
I can't believe Miss Yagami's getting
much studying done, either.

00:16:19.180 --> 00:16:20.120
I know what...!

00:16:21.730 --> 00:16:24.890
I should stay away on
their study nights.

00:16:26.230 --> 00:16:27.390
Mr. Godai!

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:31.590
What are you doing?
Your tea's getting cold.

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:33.400
Okay. I'll be right there.

00:16:35.880 --> 00:16:37.140
Hurry! Hurry!

00:16:37.200 --> 00:16:38.790
Okay, okay!

00:16:50.890 --> 00:16:52.380
Thank you for everything.

00:16:56.950 --> 00:16:58.890
I'll walk her to the station.

00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:01.390
Let's study together again.

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:02.720
Bye-bye...

00:17:02.800 --> 00:17:05.130
Thank you, Godai.

00:17:05.370 --> 00:17:07.480
No problem.
I'll be right back.

00:17:07.960 --> 00:17:09.590
Hurry, Mr. Godai!

00:17:14.000 --> 00:17:16.370
I don't know why, but I'm exhausted.

00:17:16.440 --> 00:17:17.400
So am I.

00:17:19.320 --> 00:17:22.240
How nice to be young and
free of inhibitions!

00:17:22.790 --> 00:17:27.090
Seeing how Godai's at her beck and call,
I'd say he's not immune to her.

00:17:27.480 --> 00:17:31.320
I offered to walk her
but she refused.

00:17:31.530 --> 00:17:32.550
That's understandable.

00:17:37.070 --> 00:17:38.530
Thanks for waiting.

00:17:39.140 --> 00:17:40.300
Come again soon!

00:17:40.810 --> 00:17:42.700
Oh, Ms. Otonashi!

00:17:43.280 --> 00:17:44.700
It's been such a long time!

00:17:44.940 --> 00:17:46.160
Mrs. Kami!

00:17:49.010 --> 00:17:52.000
You're here for a workshop?

00:17:52.090 --> 00:17:55.050
Yes. We ended early today.

00:17:57.820 --> 00:17:59.840
How has Godai been?

00:18:00.220 --> 00:18:00.740
Huh?

00:18:01.860 --> 00:18:03.790
Yes, well...

00:18:04.190 --> 00:18:05.060
Huh?

00:18:11.370 --> 00:18:13.480
I'm home, Soichiro.

00:18:15.000 --> 00:18:16.690
They're at it already.

00:18:24.510 --> 00:18:26.740
Y-Yagami...!

00:18:27.180 --> 00:18:28.810
Oh, welcome home.

00:18:29.820 --> 00:18:33.080
M-Manager...T-This...?

00:18:33.330 --> 00:18:34.180
Yes...

00:18:34.560 --> 00:18:36.480
But it's not tutoring night.

00:18:37.150 --> 00:18:40.710
They had to switch to today
because of Mr. Yotsuya's job.

00:18:40.920 --> 00:18:41.750
Job?

00:18:47.870 --> 00:18:49.150
Mr. Godai!

00:18:54.970 --> 00:18:57.140
Is something wrong?

00:18:57.350 --> 00:19:02.110
Oh, it's the manager...
I thought it was Mr. Godai.

00:19:02.980 --> 00:19:05.580
Now that you mention it,
he's late today, isn't he?

00:19:23.730 --> 00:19:24.420
Oh...

00:19:25.080 --> 00:19:26.430
Where's Godai?

00:19:29.650 --> 00:19:33.810
Where could he be?
He never has much to do.

00:19:34.050 --> 00:19:36.730
Well, he never has much
spending money.

00:19:37.410 --> 00:19:41.170
You don't think he's
staying away on purpose...?

00:19:41.530 --> 00:19:42.150
Huh?

00:19:45.100 --> 00:19:48.060
Actually, I'm Chandler Yotsuya.

00:19:49.400 --> 00:19:53.410
People call me Phillip Yotsuya Marlowe...

00:20:03.440 --> 00:20:05.070
Uh...

00:20:05.440 --> 00:20:06.140
Yes?

00:20:06.790 --> 00:20:08.900
I'm sorry for dropping in like this...

00:20:09.180 --> 00:20:11.350
Oh, don't worry about it.

00:20:12.130 --> 00:20:14.090
But, what a problem...

00:20:15.560 --> 00:20:18.740
She may be single-minded,
but even I...

00:20:19.160 --> 00:20:19.750
Huh?

00:20:20.190 --> 00:20:21.650
Uh, nothing...

00:20:22.040 --> 00:20:24.430
Oh, yes...
How about some cookies?

00:20:24.960 --> 00:20:26.590
They're store bought.

00:20:27.500 --> 00:20:29.690
Hello, Manager...

00:20:31.970 --> 00:20:36.160
Are you in? If not, I'm coming in.

00:20:36.240 --> 00:20:38.340
Oh, j-just a minute!

00:20:39.590 --> 00:20:41.380
Uh, did you want something?

00:20:41.620 --> 00:20:44.010
Isn't the tea ready yet?

00:20:44.090 --> 00:20:46.080
I'm sorry.
I'll bring it right up.

00:20:46.150 --> 00:20:47.200
Thank you.

00:20:47.290 --> 00:20:47.810
Bye.

00:20:48.250 --> 00:20:50.590
Oh. Did you have a guest?

00:20:54.100 --> 00:20:56.390
Yes... One of the neighbors.

00:20:56.600 --> 00:20:58.560
Oh...?

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:02.660
I'd like tendon
for dinner tomorrow.

00:21:02.730 --> 00:21:03.290
Huh?

00:21:03.380 --> 00:21:05.900
How about it, Young Godai?

00:21:06.850 --> 00:21:09.640
What are you saying? Godai's not...

00:21:10.010 --> 00:21:11.810
Katsudon the day after...

00:21:11.890 --> 00:21:12.870
If you'll excuse me...

00:21:12.940 --> 00:21:14.960
Oyakodon the day after that...

00:21:15.480 --> 00:21:19.820
And after that
unadon with soup! And...

00:21:19.890 --> 00:21:21.210
All right!

00:21:27.870 --> 00:21:28.950
Godai...

00:21:29.040 --> 00:21:30.900
Oh, good evening...

00:21:31.300 --> 00:21:34.690
But, only if you keep this
from Yagami... Swear to it!

00:21:35.140 --> 00:21:42.040
Of course! My dinners depend on it.
You'd better keep your promise.

00:21:45.550 --> 00:21:46.660
Godai!

00:21:48.590 --> 00:21:49.740
Mr. Godai!

00:21:56.560 --> 00:21:58.280
Oh, hi...

00:21:59.420 --> 00:22:02.150
Oh... There go my dinners.

00:22:03.690 --> 00:22:06.420
What's this all about, Manager?

00:22:06.500 --> 00:22:07.150
Huh?

00:22:08.500 --> 00:22:10.930
I'm asking you what this
is all about.

00:22:11.670 --> 00:22:13.800
Uh, well...this is...

00:22:14.380 --> 00:22:17.340
You lied, didn't you?
You were hiding him!

00:22:17.650 --> 00:22:19.260
I can explain, Yagami...

00:22:19.390 --> 00:22:20.970
Don't say anything, Mr. Godai!

00:22:22.290 --> 00:22:28.150
Is this how badly you want to keep
the two of us apart?

00:22:35.430 --> 00:22:40.190
Huh? She didn't!
That widow told on me?

00:22:40.660 --> 00:22:42.130
Watch your words!

00:22:42.340 --> 00:22:45.920
Ms. Otonashi told me because
she was concerned about you.

00:22:46.700 --> 00:22:50.430
More importantly, I have here
your mock exam scores.

00:22:51.280 --> 00:22:55.800
Take a look at them.
Your scores have fallen quite a bit.

00:22:55.890 --> 00:23:00.080
That tutor of yours has done
no good at all.

00:23:15.640 --> 00:23:18.460
Unforgivable!
I will never forgive her!

00:23:19.050 --> 00:23:20.660
How dare she tell on me!

00:23:21.810 --> 00:23:23.530
If that's the way she's
going to play...

00:23:26.350 --> 00:23:28.140
It's all out war!

00:23:49.900 --> 00:23:51.300
They're going at it.

00:23:51.500 --> 00:23:54.660
High school girls
have a lot of spirit.

00:23:54.780 --> 00:23:58.960
Next time:
"Yagami's Challenge:
I Won't Lose to the Widow!"

00:23:59.050 --> 00:24:01.470
I kissed Mr. Godai.
